{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","id":3212966932,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6_gfwU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115426","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115426/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fa2b30e7a17f20af33f241b5bacb75493c909b5a","number":115426,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement multi-bounce ambient occlusion approximation","user":{"login":"KenzieMac130","id":7585719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODU3MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7585719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130","html_url":"https://github.com/KenzieMac130","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This patch implements a multi-bounce ambient occlusion approximation described in [this 2016 Siggraph presentation](https://research.activision.com/publications/archives/practical-real-time-strategies-for-accurate-indirect-occlusion) that has since become widely adopted as an industry standard bounce approximation across other engines. \r\n\r\nThis approximation is applied before integrating ambient occlusion into indirect lighting. The bounce approximation affects both real-time (single bounce SSAO) and baked ambient occlusion (most often single bounce baked textures) which only stores monochromatic occlusion data. Currently this monochromatic data is directly multiplied onto color lighting can lead to over-darkening and produce artistically unpleasant gradients of color. \r\n\r\nBy bringing back some albedo data weighted along the occlusion visibility the appearance of local global illumination can be created (bringing SSAO closer to SSIL) while also creating a more artistically pleasing ambient gradient on saturated surfaces. (where otherwise directly multiplying monochromatic information on color can create sickly-grey colors)\r\n\r\nDisabled:\r\n<img width=\"717\" height=\"502\" alt=\"MBColorOff\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8a58749-97c2-4283-9b42-df4aa3e680ef\" />\r\n\r\nEnabled:\r\n<img width=\"717\" height=\"502\" alt=\"MBColorOn\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17d65675-6e3d-4b6f-87f9-59899d308343\" />\r\n\r\nThis was proposed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13928.\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit:* Implements godotengine/godot-proposals#13928","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1349613124,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzQ5NjEzMTI0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/for%20pr%20meeting","name":"for pr meeting","description":"","color":"88f795","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_rea